None

Resolution

Successfully created Organizational Units within the appropriate domain structure. Created departmental OUs and additional sub-OUs for the Sales department. Verified all Organizational Units were created in the correct locations and matched the required company structure.

Key Takeaways

- Organizational Units help structure and organize Active Directory environments.
- OUs simplify administration by grouping users, computers, and resources by department.
- Proper OU design supports scalability and easier management.
- Verifying the placement of OUs is important to maintain an organized directory structure.

